{"3994220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pile Up", "steam_appid": 3994220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Pile Up - a cozy, object stacking puzzle game with playful physics - every object matters. Work together with a friend, plan each move carefully, enchant objects with unique traits, and master balance and strategy to build the tallest pile imaginable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994220/extras/6d6b406b78390e37c6675520fd8ef1fc.poster.avif?t=1787849356\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994220/extras/6d6b406b78390e37c6675520fd8ef1fc.webm?t=1787849356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994220/extras/6d6b406b78390e37c6675520fd8ef1fc.mp4?t=1787849356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994220/extras/51dcbf81f64567d81139deb8460d2562.webp?t=1787849356\" width=412 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994220/extras/b2e650a